
# 👥 HR Attrition Analysis

## 📌 Overview
ML-powered analysis of IBM HR dataset to identify
key factors driving employee attrition.

## 📊 Analysis Performed
- 👥 Attrition rate by Department
- 💰 Monthly Income vs Attrition
- ⏰ Overtime & Job Satisfaction impact
- 🤖 Random Forest ML Model — 87.41% Accuracy
- 🎯 Top 10 Factors causing Attrition

## 🗂️ Dataset
IBM HR Analytics — 1,470 employees, 35 features

## 💡 Key Insights
- MonthlyIncome is top attrition factor
- Overtime employees leave more frequently
- Low job satisfaction increases attrition risk

## 🛠️ Tools
Python · Pandas · Scikit-learn · Matplotlib · Google Colab
